der 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 35% of normal for September to October and 36% for October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 33% of normal and May to June at 187%. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
